PETSELFTEST1
# V8 sound routines without a person: tooth brushing from the care menu
# (card 6): open, press to start, one hourglass frame, then leave early
# with a long press (no completion, no care record); the parrot from the
# play menu (Sound page): opened and left by turning the dial, the dial centre
# is never held so nothing is recorded; the song player by voice command
# PLAY_SONG on a card WITHOUT song_ / lullaby_ books (count=5: since V9-3A
# the 5 built-in melodies are always listed, so there is no hint picture;
# a card with songs lists more and this scenario fails on count=5).
# Counted from "mark begin" (tools/selftest_report.py).
# Needs: outside the quiet hours (phase day), battery above the low level.
# expect min:PET_SOUND_START 3
# expect min:kind=brush 1
# expect min:kind=parrot 1
# expect min:kind=songs 1
# expect min:PET_SONGS_OPEN 1
# expect min:count=5 1
# Stopped early: no completion, nothing recorded, nothing recorded of a voice.
# expect none:PET_CARE_ROUTINE 0
# expect none:PET_PARROT_REC 0
# expect none:PET_PARROT_PLAY 0
# expect none:PET_SONGS_LOAD 0
# The songs timer ends in the sleep flow; none may start.
# expect none:PET_SONGS_TIMER_DONE 0
# expect none:PET_SLEEP_REQUESTED 0
# expect none:PET_SOUND_REFUSED 0
# expect none:PET_SELFTEST_ABORT 0
# expect selftest_done 1
# expect max_partial_ms 2500
# expect max_full_ms 5000
phase day
volume 15
waitidle 60000
pet
wait 6000
# Normalize restored pet state to "home, neutral".
tap press 6000
hold press 1500 6000
mark begin
# Rail Story(1) -> Feed(3), press: care menu; tooth brush is card 6.
tap down 2500
tap down 2500
tap press 6000
tap down 700
tap down 700
tap down 700
tap down 700
tap down 700
tap down 700
tap press 6000
# The dial press starts it (start cue), one frame is 12 s.
tap press 3000
wait 15000
# Leave early: long press = home, quietly.
hold press 1500 8000
# Rail Feed(3) -> Game(2), press: play menu.
tap up 2500
tap press 6000
# V9: Sound page (card 3), the parrot is its 3rd card.
tap down 600
tap down 600
tap down 600
tap press 3000
tap down 600
tap down 600
tap press 6000
# Turning the dial leaves the parrot.
tap down 3000
wait 6000
# Songs by voice: no song books on the card, the built-in list.
vcmd PLAY_SONG
wait 6000
hold press 1500 8000
pet
wait 5000
end
